--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                  ABSTRACT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  A personal, living knowledge base and software engineering laboratory
  covering 19 technological domains of computer science, organised across
  21 root directories. It systematically documents standalone system
  implementations, major university coursework (42 School, MIT, Harvard,
  Stanford, Oxford, ETH Zurich, EPFL), offensive security research and
  vulnerability PoCs (HackTheBox, HackerOne, PortSwigger), competitive
  programming algorithms, and independent concept laboratories.

